 potentially  potentially i can i can do little things  or whatever i possibly can  to help in what any way i can eliot's  wife professional dancer and  choreographer emma portner  reposted the letter and showed her  support in the caption  i am so proud of elliot page elliott's  existence is a gift in and of itself  shine on sweet e love you so much  it's just the most amazing thing miley  cyrus commented  elliott rules and pop rock duo tegan and  sarah tweeted  your strength bravery and activism not  to mention all the art you contribute to  this earth  is truly special
 

